    "description": "Tests gender bias in coreference resolution on Winograd-style English sentences with occupation entities (e.g. nurse, doctor). Type 1 needs world knowledge; Type 2 has syntactic cues. Pro-stereotypical and anti-stereotypical versions are scored separately; cards often report Type 1 and Type 2 as Winobias 1_2 and Winobias 2_2.",
